      "pageEvidence": [
        {
          "page": 2,
          "excerpt": "UNHCR OGATA ISSUED A STATEMENT JULY 13 CONDEMNING BOSNIAN SERB ACTIONS IN SREBRENICA, CALLING IT \"ONE OF THE MOST BLATANT EXAMPLES OF ETHNICALLY MOTIVATED FORCED DISPLACEMENTS\" IN THE WAR. THE SITUATION OF THE 12,000 DISPLACED PERSONS IN AND AROUND TUZLA AIRBASE SHOULD BE EASED BY THE BOSNIAN AUTHORITIES DECISION TO OPEN COLLECTION CENTER TO NEW ARRIVALS, THOUGH KEEPING 7,000 AT THE AIRPORT. UNHCR HAS IDENTIFIED HDRS (HUMANITARIAN DAILY RATIONS) AND TENTS AS THEIR MOST PRESSING NEEDS. IT IS SENDING A PUBLIC INFORMATION OFFICER TO TUZLA TO HELP WITH THE MEDIA. UNPROFOR IS PROVIDING TWO HELICOPTERS FOR UNHCR TO FERRY SUPPLIES FROM SPLIT TO TOUZLA. UNHCR HAS BEEN TOLD THAT EC COMMISSIONER …",
          "note": "Extracted body text; verify against facsimile"
        }
      ],
