          "page": 2,
          "excerpt": "- |HAVE JUST COMPLETED A TWO-DAY MISSION TO CENTRAL AND NORTHEASTERN BOSNIA. MY FOCUS WAS ON EVENTS THAT OCCURRED WHEN THE BOSNIAN SERB ARMY ATTACKED AND TOOK OVER TWO UN SAFE AREAS, SREBRENICA AND ZEPA. IN PARTICULAR, | SOUGHT INFORMATION ON THE FATE OF THE THOUSANDS OF MEN, WOMEN AND CHILDREN STILL UNACCOUNTED FOR. WHAT FOLLOWS ARE THE MAIN CONCLUSIONS BASED ON MY FINDINGS. (A MORE DETAILED REPORT ON THOSE FINDINGS, INCLUDING FIRST-HAND ACCOUNTS FROM SOME DOZEN REFUGEES FROM BOTH ENCLAVES, WILL BE SENT BY EMBASSY ZAGREB.) - BASED ON WHAT | HAVE LEARNED, | OFFER TWO RECOMMENDATIONS FOR URGENT ACTION. THE FIRST IS THAT REPRESENTATIONS, BY THE USG, OTHER GOVERNMENTS, THE UN AND OTHER …",
