          "excerpt": "\"UNPROFOR IS DEAD\" 3. OUR DISCUSSIONS WITH DFA OFFICIALS ON JULY 15 REVEALED UNANIMOUS SENTIMENT THAT WITH THE FALL OF SREBRENICA, UNPROFOR IS NO LONGER EFFECTIVE OR VIABLE. LT. COL. BILL BENTLEY (PROTECT), THE HEAD OF THE DFA'S PEACEKEEPING SECTION, SAID FLATLY THAT \"WE HAVE CONCLUDED THAT UNPROFOR IS DEAD. THE FALL OF SREBRENICA IS CONCLUSIVE PROOF.\" CONSEQUENTLY, BENTLEY SAID, THE CONFIBENFAL EONABENTATTTNOFORN D-2025-00001 B-00002645813 \"UNCLASSIFIED\" Page 2 of 6",
