          "page": 2,
          "excerpt": "AMBASSADOR, ALONG WITH THE AMBASSADORS/CHARGES OF THE UK, FRANCE, GERMANY AND RUSSIA, WAS SUMMONED ON THE AFTERNOON OF JULY 25 BY PM/FM FILALI TO RECEIVE AN URGENT APPEAL FROM THE BOSNIA-HERZEGOVINA CONTACT GROUP OF THE ORGANIZATION OF THE ISLAMIC CONFERENCE (OIC) OF WHICH KING HASSAN IS PRESIDENT. FILALI INFORMED US THAT KING HASSAN WAS REQUESTED BY THE OIC'S CONTACT GROUP TO SEEK AN IMMEDIATE MINISTERIAL LEVEL MEETING BETWEEN THE OIC CONTACT GROUP (WHICH INCLUDES BOSNIA AND HERZEGOVINA, EGYPT, IRAN, MALAYSIA, PAKISTAN, SAUDI ARABIA, SENEGAL, TURKEY AND MOROCCO) WITH THE BOSNIA INTERNATIONAL CONTACT GROUP EITHER IN GENEVA, PARIS OR LONDON. 3. FILALI ADVISED THAT THE OIC \"DOES NOT …",
