          "page": 2,
          "excerpt": "PRIME MINISTER SILAJDZIC, DRAINED AND DOWNCAST, CALLED ME IN TWICE JULY 11 TO INFORM ME OF THE CONFIBENTIAL CONRIBEN FAL PAGE 02 SARAJE 00324 1117142 SPIRALING CRISIS IN SREBRENICA AND TO CRITICIZE U.S. POLICY ON LIFT. END SUMMARY. 3. PRIME MINISTER SILAJDZIC CALLED ME IN ON AN URGENT BASIS AT 1400 JULY 11 TO DISCUSS DEVELOPMENTS IN SREBRENICA. HE SAID HE HAD SPOKEN WITH THE MAYOR OF SREBRENICA BY RADIO 0600 THIS MORNING. THE MAYOR ASKED, \"IS MY CITY UNDER A DEATH SENTENCE?” THE MAYOR HAD RADIOED IN AGAIN AT 1330 AND SIGNED OFF, \"THIS IS MY LAST CALL, THIS IS THE END.\" 4. THE PM, LOOKING EXHAUSTED AND DESPONDENT, SAID THE ENCLAVE WAS FALLING TO THE BSA. PANIC HAD BROKEN OUT IN THE STREETS. …",
