          "page": 2,
          "excerpt": "MODERATE FIGHTING CONTINUED IN SARAJEVO, WITH TARGETTING OF UN TROOPS BY BOTH WARRING FACTIONS. GAINS AROUND THE NORTHERN BIHAC SAFE AREA WERE CLAIMED BY BOTH SIDES ON JULY 7. BOSNIAN SERB SHELLING OF CIVILIAN AREAS CONTINUED IN GORAZDE. INTENSE FIGHTING CONTINUED IN SREBRENICA, FORCING UN TROOPS TO ABANDON OBSERVATION POSTS. BOSNIAN SERBS SHELLED ZEPA FOR THE PAST TWO DAYS, INJURING AT LEAST 21 CIVILIANS. TUZLA WAS QUIET. STATUS OF SARAJEVO AND THE OTHER UN-DECLARED SAFE AREAS SARAJEVO SEGRE PAGE 03 STATE 165369 111413Z B-00002645847 \"UNCLASSIFIED\" Page 2 of 6",
