          "page": 2,
          "excerpt": "2. | INVITED UK PERMREP HANNAY, FRENCH PERMREP MERIMEE AND NEWLY ARRIVED GERMAN PERMREP EITEL TO AN UNINSTRUCTED, INFORMAL, JULY 12 MEETING TO TALK ABOUT BOSNIA IN LIGHT OF RECENT EVENTS IN SREBRENICA. DURING A LENGTHY DISCUSSION WE DISCUSSED: (1) THE LIKELY EUROPEAN REACTION IF THE SENATE ADOPTS A BILL CALLING FOR UNILATERAL LIFT, (2) PROVIDING HUMANITARIAN ASSISTANCE TO THE CIVILIAN POPULATION OF SREBRENCIA, (3) THE EFFECT SUCCESSFUL SERB OFFENSIVES AGAINST ZEPA AND GORAZDE COULD HAVE ON UNPROFOR'S FUTURE, AND (4) LONGER-TERM OPTIONS. THE EUROPEANS WERE VERY EAGER FOR OUR DISCUSSION TO BE CONTINUED AT HIGH LEVEL, PERHAPS POLITICAL DIRECTORS, AND WITH THE ATTENDANCE OF MILITARY EXPERTS. …",
